# Real HYP audio DSP: Jazz Rap must NOT depress all chord notes at once.
# Per-note timing is quantized to audio samples (14–24 ms spacing).
expect urbanpianorolls 0
expect urbanpianonotes 0
spin K2 3
spin K3 1
expect urbansub 1
tap PLAY
wait 7500
expect playing 1
expect urbanpianorolls >0
expect urbanpianonotes >3
shot pianist-audio-key-presses.png
tap PLAY
expect playing 0
